        <tr><td><strong>Metacircular Gate Boot</strong></td><td><code>hypertensor.hypercubical</code> · <code>cub2silicon-boot-certs</code></td><td>Unverified compiler + RTL-only simulation</td><td><strong>6,342-cell 7nm CMOS7 gate netlist</strong> boots HO $\lambda$+<code>DUP</code> (`42`, 3 cyc) &amp; Flash+MoE (`54`, 6 cyc) bit-exact</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>De Novo Pocket Binder</strong></td><td><code>chem/pocket-binder.hypercubical</code> · <code>lead-binder-globally-optimal</code></td><td>Diffusion hallucination / GPU-weeks MD</td><td><strong>60/64 (93.75%) pruned</strong> at depth 1–2; globally optimal $\Delta G^* = -19$ kcal/mol, 0 steric clashes</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Bare-Metal OS &amp; Crypto</strong></td><td><code>lib/os/hyperos.hypercubical</code> · <code>sip-ring0-noninterference</code>, <code>chacha20-rfc8439-cert</code></td><td>28M-line Linux kernel, 1,945.5-cyc syscall, unverified C</td><td><strong>15 KB Ring-0 <code>hyperos.elf</code></strong> boots in QEMU; <strong>3.5-cyc SIP (551.3× faster)</strong>; RFC 8439 ChaCha20 + conserved <code>PoUW</code> credit</td></tr>
